71146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LyzykOYSHZkQ7kNvwHm283F&_nc_oc=Adq3rZJ3tvuJHk06BCTJJbLSYurPapcUg7RbEVRtVafMaJcyPDYTYASbNGRSvCmMcjA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS20s5xDpOXey7Ug5C7mvqvzWpj9lqZvmazrQ7mZpB8WQ&oe=6AF0ACF9"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=18hmRnZKMZYQ7kNvwGUCH7q&_nc_oc=AdrIhzRBpt2Pt-nVtVP5i2yjuTR75R1TON8hy9wDAXbFCibBqcwCydFjj1V5yTZ5RY0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSdiSH0FSLXjswTvaE3_1SAjWmJH-jqCaKz6CQcNbWreg&oe=6AF08793"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OKCgjD4MitwQ7kNvwErjHnw&_nc_oc=Adpi6Gp_A5h01FPdBy5OLFsqhpWVkGYyBdOenjka8JzdQKKfRmd3J2aMhzXV_xVQZr8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTYC7bP1HyMPXraIqSFQU9LSAldg1qco9tjrRzAQ_FQ3g&oe=6AF085DA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https: